    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d479">

                <pb facs="0935" n="913" xml:id="pg913"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">350/5–1950: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the United States
                        Delegation at the United Nations </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-05-24T19:00:00-04:00">May 24, 1950—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>268. Ur 443 May 19. You are authorized inform Eban that Dept appreciates kindness
                    of Israeli Del in making available draft memo<anchor n="1" xml:id="d479-f1"/> to
                    be presented by Israeli Govt to TC on question of Jerusalem. You may add that in
                    Dept’s opinion new Israeli proposal is forward step by Israel toward agreement
                    between Jordan, Israel and Internatl Community on Jerusalem.</p>
                <p>For your info, Dept does not wish to become involved at this stage in substantive
                    discussion with Israel Del on Israeli proposal. Dept wld also not wish to see
                    impression created in UN that USG has given substantive approval to new Israeli
                    proposal or is supporting Israeli initiative in circulating new proposal in
                    UN.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Week</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d479-f1" n="1" xml:id="d479-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram 443, May 19, from New York, <ref target="#pg903">p. 903</ref>.</p>
            </note>
